@startuml
' Business symbols extracted from course PPT PDF pages 86-87.
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 220
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ActorBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBorderColor transparent
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 ActivationBorderColor black
 ActivationBackgroundColor white
}
actor "患者" as P
participant "<img:business-worker.png>\n收费人员" as C
participant "<img:business-worker.png>\n牙医" as D
P -> C : 提交诊疗单，请求结算
activate C
C -> C : 核对患者与本次诊疗单（c）
C -> D : 核实诊疗项目及数量
activate D
D --> C : 确认已完成的项目及数量
deactivate D
C -> C : 查阅价目表，计算本次应收费用
C -> P : 说明收费项目及应付金额
P --> C : 确认费用并交付现金
C -> C : 清点款项，登记实收与找零
C -> P : 交付收据及找零，确认结清（d）
deactivate C
@enduml
